flowchart TD
    Start([Emergency Terjadi]) --> Trigger[Trigger Emergency Alert]
    Trigger --> SecurityAkses[Security Akses Emergency List]
    SecurityAkses --> AmbilData[Ambil Data Visitor Aktif]
    AmbilData --> TampilList[Tampilkan List Visitor di Lokasi]
    TampilList --> Evakuasi[Evakuasi Visitor]
    Evakuasi --> UpdateStatus[Update Status Check-out]
    UpdateStatus --> NotifAdmin[Notifikasi ke Admin]
    NotifAdmin --> Laporan[Laporan Emergency]
    Laporan --> Selesai([Selesai])